meeting global health food trends.</p></li></ul></li></ol><hr class="" data-start="1336" data-end="1339" /><h2 data-start="1341" data-end="1385"><strong data-start="1346" data-end="1383">Applications &amp; Usage Instructions</strong></h2><h3 data-start="1387" data-end="1407"><strong data-start="1387" data-end="1405">Applications</strong></h3><ul data-start="1408" data-end="1975"><li class="" data-start="1408" data-end="1539"><p class="" data-start="1410" data-end="1539"><strong data-start="1410" data-end="1427">Food Industry</strong>: Used in bread, cakes, oat products, and plant-based meat to enhance texture, thickening, and emulsification.</p></li><li class="" data-start="1540" data-end="1666"><p class="" data-start="1542" data-end="1666"><strong data-start="1542" data-end="1563">Beverage Industry</strong>: Added to shakes, plant-based protein drinks to improve suspension stability and prevent separation.</p></li><li class="" data-start="1667" data-end="1767"><p class="" data-start="1669" data-end="1767"><strong data-start="1669" data-end="1691">Health &amp; Nutrition</strong>: Rich in <strong data-start="1701" data-end="1726">soluble dietary fiber</strong>, used in health foods and supplements.</p></li><li class="" data-start="1768" data-end="1858"><p class="" data-start="1770" data-end="1858"><strong data-start="1770" data-end="1782">Pet Food</strong>: Acts as a natural thickener, improving texture and nutritional benefits.</p></li><li class="" data-start="1859" data-end="1975"><p class="" data-start="1861" data-end="1975"><strong data-start="1861" data-end="1874">Cosmetics</strong>: Used in skincare products such as lotions and masks for natural viscosity and moisture retention.</p></li></ul><h3 data-start="1977" data-end="2004"><strong data-start="1977" data-end="2002">Usage Instructions</strong></h3><ul data-start="2005" data-end="2345"><li class="" data-start="2005" data-end="2091"><p class="" data-start="2007" data-end="2091"><strong data-start="2007" data-end="2031">Use twice the amount</strong> compared to pure flaxseed gum to achieve the same effect.</p></li><li class="" data-start="2092" data-end="2187"><p class="" data-start="2094" data-end="2187">It is best to <strong data-start="2108" data-end="2150">dissolve in warm water (40-60°C) first</strong> and stir well to prevent clumping.</p></li><li class="" data-start="2188" data-end="2345"><p class="" data-start="2190" data-end="2237">Recommended dosage in different applications:</p><ul data-start="2240" data-end="2345"><li class="" data-start="2240" data-end="2263"><p class="" data-start="2242" data-end="2263">Baking: <strong data-start="2250" data-end="2261">1%-3%</strong></p></li><li class="" data-start="2266" data-end="2302"><p class="" data-start="2268" data-end="2302">Beverage stabilizer: <strong data-start="2289" data-end="2300">1%-2%</strong></p></li><li class="" data-start="2305" data-end="2345"><p class="" data-start="2307" data-end="2345">Plant-based meat products: <strong data-start="2334" data-end="2343">2%-4%</strong></p></li></ul></li></ul><hr class="" data-start="2347" data-end="2350" /><h2 data-start="2352" data-end="2400"><strong data-start="2357" data-end="2398">Advantages of Inner Mongolia Flaxseed</strong></h2><ol data-start="2402" data-end="3253"><li class="" data-start="2402" data-end="2676"><p class="" data-start="2405" data-end="2439"><strong data-start="2405" data-end="2437">Superior Growing Environment</strong></p><ul data-start="2443" data-end="2676"><li class="" data-start="2443" data-end="2598"><p class="" data-start="2445" data-end="2598"><strong data-start="2445" data-end="2529">Cold, dry climate with significant temperature differences between day and night</strong> promotes nutrient accumulation, leading to <strong data-start="2573" data-end="2595">higher gum content</strong>.</p></li><li class="" data-start="2602" data-end="2676"><p class="" data-start="2604" data-end="2676">Fertile soil and low pollution ensure <strong data-start="2642" data-end="2673">pure, high-quality flaxseed</strong>.</p></li></ul></li><li class="" data-start="2678" data-end="2867"><p class="" data-start="2681" data-end="2708"><strong data-start="2681" data-end="2706">Rich in Dietary Fiber</strong></p><ul data-start="2712" data-end="2867"><li class="" data-start="2712" data-end="2867"><p class="" data-start="2714" data-end="2867">The flaxseed shells from Inner Mongolia contain high levels of <strong data-start="2777" data-end="2802">soluble dietary fiber</strong>, which enhances <strong data-start="2819" data-end="2864">thickening and emulsification performance</strong>.</p></li></ul></li><li class="" data-start="2869" data-end="3085"><p class="" data-start="2872" data-end="2911"><strong data-start="2872" data-end="2909">Non-GMO &amp; Sustainable Agriculture</strong></p><ul data-start="2915" data-end="3085"><li class="" data-start="2915" data-end="2992"><p class="" data-start="2917" data-end="2992">The flaxseed is <strong data-start="2933" data-end="2944">non-GMO</strong>, complying with global food safety standards.</p></li><li class="" data-start="2996" data-end="3085"><p class="" data-start="2998" data-end="3085">Grown using <strong data-start="3010" data-end="3041">sustainable farming methods</strong>, ensuring <strong data-start="3052" data-end="3082">long-term supply stability</strong>.</p></li></ul></li><li class="" data-start="3087" data-end="3253"><p class="" data-start="3090" data-end="3130"><strong data-start="3090" data-end="3128">Cost-Effective Raw Material Source</strong></p><ul data-start="3134" data-end="3253"><li class="" data-start="3134" data-end="3253"><p class="" data-start="3136" data-end="3253"><strong data-start="3136" data-end="3157">Locally processed</strong>, reducing transportation and import costs, making it <strong data-start="3211" data-end="3250">a competitive and affordable choice</strong>.</p></li></ul></li></ol><h2 data-start="3262" data-end="3282">FAQs</h2><h4 class="" data-start="66" data-end="158"><strong data-start="71" data-end="156">1. What is the difference between this Flaxseed Gum Powder and pure flaxseed gum?</strong></h4><p class="" data-start="159" data-end="453">This Flaxseed Gum Powder contains <strong data-start="193" data-end="212">55% gum content</strong>, while <strong data-start="220" data-end="241">pure flaxseed gum</strong> has over <strong data-start="251" data-end="270">90% gum content</strong> and appears milky white. Since this product has a lower gum concentration, <strong data-start="346" data-end="382">you need to use twice the amount</strong> compared to pure flaxseed gum to achieve the same thickening effect.</p><h4 class="" data-start="455" data-end="499"><strong data-start="460" data-end="497">2. How is this product processed?</strong></h4><p class="" data-start="500" data-end="743">It is produced using a <strong data-start="523" data-end="556">pure physical milling process</strong>, without chemical solvent extraction. This ensures <strong data-start="608" data-end="632">no chemical residues</strong> and maintains <strong data-start="647" data-end="684">100% natural flaxseed composition</strong>, making it safer and more natural for food applications.</p><h4 class="" data-start="745" data-end="826"><strong data-start="750" data-end="824">3. Is this product classified as a food ingredient or a food additive?</strong></h4><p class="" data-start="827" data-end="1027">This product is classified as a <strong data-start="859" data-end="878">food ingredient</strong> rather than a food additive. It can also be referred to as <strong data-start="938" data-end="957">flaxseed powder</strong> and should be declared as <strong data-start="984" data-end="1003">flaxseed powder</strong> in customs clearance.</p><h4 class="" data-start="1029" data-end="1082"><strong data-start="1034" data-end="1080">4. Where is the raw material sourced from?</strong></h4><p class="" data-start="1083" data-end="1306">The flaxseed used in this product comes from <strong data-start="1128" data-end="1153">Inner Mongolia, China</strong>, a region known for its <strong data-start="1178" data-end="1217">cold climate and nutrient-rich soil</strong>, which enhances the quality and gum content of the flaxseed shells used in production.</p><h4 class="" data-start="1308" data-end="1381"><strong data-start="1313" data-end="1379">5. What are the main applications of this Flaxseed Gum Powder?</strong></h4><ul data-start="1382" data-end="1760"><li class="" data-start="1382" data-end="1489"><p class="" data-start="1384" data-end="1489"><strong data-start="1384" data-end="1401">Food industry</strong>: Used in bread, cakes, oat-based foods, and plant-based meat for texture improvement.</p></li><li class="" data-start="1490" data-end="1562"><p class="" data-start="1492" data-end="1562"><strong data-start="1492" data-end="1505">Beverages</strong>: Stabilizer for shakes and plant-based protein drinks.</p></li><li class="" data-start="1563" data-end="1645"><p class="" data-start="1565" data-end="1645"><strong data-start="1565" data-end="1587">Health &amp; nutrition</strong>: Rich in soluble dietary fiber, ideal for health foods.</p></li><li class="" data-start="1646" data-end="1692"><p class="" data-start="1648" data-end="1692"><strong data-start="1648" data-end="1660">Pet food</strong>: Acts as a natural thickener.</p></li><li class="" data-start="1693" data-end="1760"><p class="" data-start="1695" data-end="1760"><strong data-start="1695" data-end="1708">Cosmetics</strong>: Used in lotions and masks for natural viscosity.</p></li></ul><h4 class="" data-start="1762" data-end="1816"><strong data-start="1767" data-end="1814">6. Is this product gluten-free and non-GMO?</strong></h4><p class="" data-start="1817" data-end="1976">Yes, this Flaxseed Gum Powder is <strong data-start="1850" data-end="1870">100% gluten-free</strong> and <strong data-start="1875" data-end="1886">non-GMO</strong>, making it suitable for health-conscious con